				"An ultra-detailed, cinematic close-up shot featuring two 3D CGI animated characters gazing intently into each other's eyes. Composed as a profile close-up, the left side features a male character with tousled brown hair and thick eyebrows, wearing a stern yet resolute expression. On the right stands a female character with soft, short pink hair and a pair of highly expressive, oversized anime-style eyes; she wears a teal fabric hood and bears a stubborn, serious expression. The background consists of war-torn ruins engulfed in raging flames, illuminated by the fiery glow of orange-red light. The scene utilizes volumetric lighting to render the fire effects, with rim lighting highlighting the contours of the characters' hair and faces. The skin texture is hyper-realistic, revealing every pore and surface detail; the hair rendering achieves photorealistic fidelity. The image employs subsurface scattering techniques and features an extremely shallow depth of field, creating an atmosphere that is both epic in scale and charged with dramatic tension. High-detail Octane rendering; Unreal Engine 5; 8K resolution; sharp and crisp focus.",
